# Cloudflare Pages _redirects: serve the single-file site for every real path.
# The client router reads location.pathname, so /books, /about, /blog and
# /blog/<slug> all load index.html and show the right page. /admin is the
# private login page (not linked anywhere public). Old #/ links are handled
# client-side by the router, which replaces them with the real path.
# Static files under /assets/ and /api/ are NOT rewritten by these rules.
/ /index.html 200
/books /index.html 200
/about /index.html 200
/speaking /index.html 200
/faq /index.html 200
/blog /index.html 200
/blog/* /index.html 200
/contact /index.html 200
/admin /index.html 200
